{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54955","headline":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 六十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 六十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诸鸣鸟，不利叫三声。\n一语（辛本、川本、京本作「与」）五声将快和（京本作「利」），若逢（京本作「过」）此数不堪听，一任彻更（辛本、川本、京本作「天」）鸣。\n（《易》云：「三多凶。\n」故不利。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}